tion\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TempoMap","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TempoMap","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"TempoMap"},"doc://IvorTiming/documentation/IvorTiming":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Musical time, duration, and tempo types."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivortiming","title":"IvorTiming"}}}